# 2v2 gasless 15/15/15 roach build with all 4 queens on time (2nd pair as the 1st pair pops).
# Found with scripts/bo_search.py (stages G-H, 2026-10-14, patch 5.0.17); checked on all 4
# spawns of Reclamation LE and New Bed of Chaos LE: 6 roaches out 3:56-4:08, 40-47 drones at 4:00.
# - queens 1+2 started together (wait for 350): costs nothing measurable, and the injects then
#   pop in sync by themselves for the rest of the game
# - overlords 27/28 from the main (26/27 is equivalent; a single overlord adds ~7 s supply block)
# - both gases at 2:38 (main + natural), the next 6 drones rallied to them
# - warren asked for at 2:48; it starts ~2:50 once the 2nd pair of queens is paid for
# - roaches one by one as gas/minerals allow (3:30-3:39); larva waits ~9-13 s for resources
#   between roaches, but no hatchery sits at 3 larva for more than ~3 s
# - 3rd hatch last, ~3:50-3:58
14 extractor_trick
15 hatch natural
-  default main
14 extractor_trick
15 overlord
15 pool
@natural_soon transfer 4 main natural
-  default fill
& @2:38 extractor main
& @2:38 extractor natural
& @2:38 rally gas:main x3
& @2:38 rally gas:natural x3
& @2:48 roach_warren
& @warren roaches 6 asap
& @roaches hatch third
@pool queens main natural
27 overlord main
28 overlord main
@queen:main queen main
@queen:natural queen natural
-  auto_overlords
